                `👉 <code>/schedule &lt;frequency&gt;</code>\n\n` +
                `<i>Options:</i>\n` +
                `• <code>/schedule 8:30 11:30 2:30 5:30 8:30</code> (5x daily recruiter sync)\n` +
                `• <code>/schedule 3x daily</code> (8am, 1pm, 6pm)\n` +
                `• <code>/schedule daily</code> (9:00 AM)\n` +
                `• <code>/schedule every 2 hours</code>\n` +
