                text: `💡 <b>Welcome to JobRyt!</b>\n\nType <code>/help</code> to view available commands, or tap <code>/apply</code>, <code>/resume</code>, <code>/coverletter</code>, or <code>/score</code> to start.`
              },
              json: true
            });
