      const candidateSkills = Array.isArray(masterProfile.skills) ? masterProfile.skills.join(', ') : '';

      const scorePrompt = `You are a world-class AI executive recruiter evaluating a job description for candidate ${masterProfile.name || 'Candidate'}.
Target Roles: ${targetTitles.join(', ')}
Candidate Verified Skills: ${candidateSkills}
Job Title: ${jobData.title}
Job Description:
${jobData.description}

EVALUATION RULES & MODERN ATS SCORING:
1. title_fit_score (35%): Direct alignment. Modern ATS heavily weights current/target title matches.
2. skills_fit_score (35%): Semantic & Contextual overlap. Evaluate if candidate's skills fulfill the core requirements.
3. seniority_fit_score (15%): Alignment with candidate's years of experience.
4. domain_fit_score (15%): Industry relevance and company tier.

OVERALL SCORE FORMULA:
overall_score = Math.round((title_fit_score * 0.35) + (skills_fit_score * 0.35) + (seniority_fit_score * 0.15) + (domain_fit_score * 0.15))
CRITICAL CONSTRAINT: If title_fit_score < 50, overall_score MUST be capped at <= 45 and should_apply MUST be false.

Evaluate fit and respond ONLY with JSON:
{
  "overall_score": number,
  "breakdown": {
    "title_fit_score": number,
    "skills_fit_score": number,
    "seniority_fit_score": number,
